### ============================================================
### Meta Service - 공통코드 APIs
### ============================================================

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 부모 ID로 하위 공통코드 조회
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/meta-service/common-code/parent/PARENT_CODE_ID
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 특정 공통코드 조회
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/meta-service/common-code/CODE_ID
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 공통코드 생성 (Admin용 - TODO)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/meta-service/common-code
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "NEW_CODE",
  "parentId": "PARENT_CODE",
  "name": "New Code Name",
  "description": "Description here",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 공통코드 수정 (Admin용 - TODO)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{baseUrl}}/meta-service/common-code
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "EXISTING_CODE",
  "name": "Updated Code Name",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 공통코드 삭제 (TODO)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/meta-service/common-code
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 위젯 문장 목록 + 빈 시간대 (LUT-775, 내부 API)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/widget-messages?condition=NOT_DONE
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 위젯 문장 작성 (LUT-775) — 22~2 는 자정을 넘는 구간
### ----------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/widget-messages
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "start_hour": 22,
  "end_hour": 2,
  "condition": "NOT_DONE",
  "text_ko": "아직 늦지 않았어요. 자기 전 5분, 오늘을 채워 볼까요?",
  "text_en": "It's not too late. Five minutes before bed to finish today?",
  "active": true,
  "sort_order": 9
}
